      "text": "Yes.  You just need to write a format file to do it.\n\nGot a very old easy module for that:\n\ngithub.com/StartAutomat...\n\nTable formatters can right align or center a column\n\nWrite-FormatView -TypeName Foo -Property bar, baz -AlignProperty @{baz='Right'}"
